<title>ITALY: TENNIS-BOLOGNA INTERNATIONAL MEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BOLOGNA INTERNATIONAL MEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BOLOGNA, Italy 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round result in the $328,000 Bologna international men's clay court tennis tournament played late on Monday (prefix denotes seeds): Davide Scala (Italy) beat 7-Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 6-4 7-5.</p>
</text>
